# {{project_name}}

{{description}}

Hexagonal Rust service starter with explicit `domain`, `ports`, and `adapters` modules plus a release profile tuned for memory-constrained targets (such as GCP `e2-micro`).

## Release Profile (`e2-micro` RAM Budget)

`Cargo.toml` configures `[profile.release]` with `lto = true`, `codegen-units = 1`, `strip = true`, and `opt-level = "z"` to minimize binary footprint and resident memory.

